{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やあ( ・∨・)ノ\nろってぃ〜♪だよ 。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわこんばむわ //"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/06/08/1753736/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑暑くて髪の毛束ねてるねん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の晩、\nまひろ、かずみん、あにあに、ひなで\n原宿にパンケーキを\n食べに行ったよ(((/・∨・)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめてよ はじめてよ\nまひろ初めてぇ〜(*´∨`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったーーー\nこりゃすごいねぇ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっぎょいホイップクリームの\n量だったお〜(〃∨〃)\nおいち過ぎたよ love"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/06/08/1753736/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ ずーさんが、、、(・・;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/06/08/1753736/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、 写った (*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ ギリギリう写り込めた,\nやったぁ。くんくん わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晩御飯を済ませて\nそのまま まひろん家へ帰宅☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の晩は ほんっと楽しかったよ(￣∇￣*)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず家着いて\nササササッと お風呂さんしてねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TSUTAYAでホラー映画\n一本借りてきててねっ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなは パソコン机の所で\n何か書いてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろとあみはベッドの上で\nひたすら映画見てて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんは怖くて\nじゅうたんの上で\nテレビに背向けて\nずっと まひろらの方向向いてたよ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てへんのに 音だけ聞いて\nめちゃびくびくしてた (´∨`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見終わってからも\nずっとひたすらお喋りしててんけど\n笑いが止まらんかったよ\nまったくーー(☆∀☆)わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆、 顔が 顔がっ )))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また 遊びおいでよーー //"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は 皆 写真撮影だっから\nそのまま一緒にお仕事行きました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろの新衣装 次のブログに\n載せるねぇ〜ん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、プリンシパルの時\nお花送ってくださり\nありがとうございました！\n写メりましたぁ〜 \\(*´∨`*)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほなねん 皆様、\nおやすみなさい(〃ω〃)のし"}],"source":"archive"}